href=""http://www.mailpound.com/mpdirect"">www.mailpound.com/mpdirect</a>
    <li>To register FREE at MailPound:<br>
      <a
href=""http://www.mailpound.com/registration/"">
www.mailpound.com/registration/</a></li>
  </ul>
</ul>
<div dir=""ltr"">
  <br>
  <font size=""2"">Sincerely,</font>
</div>
<div>
  &nbsp;
</div>
<div>
  <font size=""2"">Bob Maier, President<br>
