jamesr@best.com,Re: whoa,"On 9/8/02 3:16 PM, ""Gary Lawrence Murphy"" <garym@canada.com> wrote:
>>>>>> ""J"" == James Rogers <jamesr@best.com> writes:
> 
>   J> An example: Being able to model RF propagation in three
