[2] http://eldred.cc/
[3] http://vitanuova.loyalty.org/2002-10-02.html
[4] http://www.nytimes.com/2002/10/05/opinion/05AMAR.html
[5] http://www.bordersstores.com/events/event_detail.jsp?SEID=15127444


