<font size=""+1""><b>Tackling tough issues in e-customer service</b></a></font><br>



Identity services let e-commerce sites better serve customers and secure their 
transactions. Both <b>Passport</b> and the <b>Liberty Alliance</b> offer merchants 
some ability to recognize customers. Check out this overview of today's identity 
services--and find out why <b>PKI</b> is not dead yet. 


