WorldCom woes dominate, BearShare 4.0 isn't what it used to be,
and Jaguar runs ahead of schedule.</font>
<br>

<font face=""arial, helvetica"" size=""-1""><i>--Laura Lindhe, executive editor, CNET Tech Trends</i></font>
<p> 

<table width=""100%"" cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0 border=0>

<tr valign=top><td align=right><font face=""arial, helvetica"" color=""#660000""><b>1</b></font></td>

