3.41MB<BR>Minimum requirements: Windows 95/98/Me/NT/2000/XP
</FONT><BR><BR>Surf like a pro with the latest update of this high-performance Web browser. Opera gives you SLL support, tons of
   keyboard shortcuts, the choice of a single- or multiple-document interface, and a lot of other useful features. This
   update includes minor enhancements and bug fixes.<p>

