  <tr> 
    <td width=""10"">&nbsp;</td>
    <td colspan=""2""><font face=""Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"">Canon has a dedicated team of Account Executives whose mission is to work with you to achieve our mutual business goals.<br>
      <br>
      Check the list below and note the name and e-mail address of the Account Executive assigned to your state.  Be sure to contact your Account Executive for support with the following:
</font></td>
