<font size=""-1"">
Recording artist <b>Janis Ian</b> throws down the gauntlet to the National Academy of Recording Arts & Sciences (home of the Grammy Awards) and the Recording Industry Association of America. Making the case for the salutary benefits of free digital downloads, she says the music industry is dancing to the wrong beat.</font><br>
<font size=""-1"">
