<font size=""+1""><b>CRM's dirty little secret</b></a></font><br>

The goal of CRM is to reduce costs, increase revenues, and boost customer loyalty. But what if your <B>data is dirty</B>? Tech Update's <B>Adrian Mello</B> has tips on how companies can cut down on inaccurate and potentially damaging customer data.

<br><img src=""http://www.zdnet.com/techupdate/i/arrow_blue.gif"" width=""8"" height=""10"" border=""0"">
<a href=""http://clickthru.online.com/Click?q=06-fP6uI481hKwtTVomap_vCgSyiL4R"" >
<b>Clean up your act</b></a>


<p>

